{"id":"H3887","lemma":"לִיץ","transliteration":"luts","sayIt":"luts","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to mock","meaning":"1) to scorn, make mouths at, talk arrogantly\n1a) (Qal)\n1a1) to boast\n1a2) to scorn\n1b) (Hiphil)\n1b1) to mock, deride\n1b2) to interpret (language)\n1b2a) interpreter (participle)\n1b2b) ambassador (fig.)\n1c) (Hithpalpel) to be inflated, scoff, act as a scorner, show oneself a mocker\nAlso means: la.tsats (לָצַץ \"to scorn\" H3945)","glosses":["mocker","mockers","mocks","mock","there was an interpreter","when ambassadors"],"count":27,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"there was an interpreter"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-32","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"when ambassadors","kjv":"in the business of the ambassadors"}},{"chapterId":"job-16","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"are my scoffers","kjv":"scorn"}},{"chapterId":"job-33","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"mediator","kjv":"an interpreter"}},{"chapterId":"psa-1","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"of mockers"}},{"chapterId":"psa-119","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"deride me","kjv":"in derision"}},{"chapterId":"pro-1","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"long will scoffers delight","kjv":"and the scorners"}},{"chapterId":"pro-3","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"mocks","kjv":"Surely he scorneth"}},{"chapterId":"pro-9","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"a mocker","kjv":"a scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-9","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"a mocker","kjv":"not a scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-9","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"but if you scoff","kjv":"but if thou scornest"}},{"chapterId":"pro-13","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"but a mocker","kjv":"but a scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-14","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"A mocker","kjv":"A scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-14","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"mock","kjv":"make a mock"}},{"chapterId":"pro-15","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"A mocker","kjv":"A scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-19","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"a mocker","kjv":"a scorner"}},{"chapterId":"pro-19","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb